<svg viewBox="0 0 28 28"><rect height="16" rx="3" width="20" x="4" y="6"></rect><path d="M4 11h20M9 17h4M16 17h3"></path></svg>
</span>
<span class="mega-link__copy">
<strong>Company Store Launch</strong>
<small>Launch a Shopify print on demand company store and capture repeat client orders.</small>
</span>
<span aria-hidden="true" class="mega-link__arrow">↗</span>
</a>
<a class="mega-link" href="/solutions/shopify-sage-connect-integration/">
<span aria-hidden="true" class="mega-link__icon mega-link__icon--mint">
<svg viewBox="0 0 28 28"><circle cx="7" cy="14" r="3"></circle><circle cx="21" cy="7" r="3"></circle><circle cx="21" cy="21" r="3"></circle><path d="m10 13 8-5M10 15l8 5"></path></svg>
</span>
<span class="mega-link__copy">
<strong>SAGE Powered Company Store</strong>
<small>Give clients a modern Shopify storefront while keeping the SAGE workflow your team knows.</small>
</span>
<span aria-hidden="true" class="mega-link__arrow">↗</span>
</a>
<a class="mega-link" href="/solutions/enterprise-shopify-automation/">
<span aria-hidden="true" class="mega-link__icon mega-link__icon--lavender">
<svg viewBox="0 0 28 28"><path d="M5 8h7v7H5zM16 5h7v7h-7zM16 17h7v7h-7z"></path><path d="M12 11h4M19.5 12v5"></path></svg>
</span>
<span class="mega-link__copy">
<strong>Enterprise Company Store Automation</strong>
<small>Centralize multi store operations, PunchOut, purchase orders, accounting, and approvals.</small>
</span>
<span aria-hidden="true" class="mega-link__arrow">↗</span>
</a>
<a class="mega-link" href="/solutions/custom-software-automation/">
<span aria-hidden="true" class="mega-link__icon mega-link__icon--peach">
<svg viewBox="0 0 28 28"><path d="M8 7h12v14H8z"></path><path d="M5 11h3M20 11h3M5 17h3M20 17h3M11 4v3M17 4v3M11 21v3M17 21v3"></path><path d="M12 12h4v4h-4z"></path></svg>
</span>
<span class="mega-link__copy">
<strong>Custom Software &amp; Automation</strong>
<small>Build custom software, integrations, SaaS and automation around the way your business works.</small>
</span>
<span aria-hidden="true" class="mega-link__arrow">↗</span>
</a>
</div>
</div>
