<span>Find the right starting point</span>
<strong>Launch. Connect. Scale. Build.</strong>
<small>Four clear routes, from company stores to custom software and automation.</small>
</div>
</a>
</section>
</div>
<div class="desktop-nav__item" data-mega-item="">
<a aria-controls="megaPlatform" aria-expanded="false" class="desktop-nav__trigger" href="/platforms/">
<span>Platforms</span>
<svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="m4 6 4 4 4-4"></path></svg>
