<text x="105" y="78" text-anchor="middle" fill="#202124" font-size="11" font-weight="800">SOLUTIONS</text>
<text x="255" y="70" text-anchor="middle" fill="#202124" font-size="12" font-weight="800">PROMO PLUS</text>
