</svg>
</div>
<div class="mega-visual__caption">
<span>Four independent products</span>
<strong>Choose the platform that fits.</strong>
<small>Each product solves a different operational problem in promotional products.</small>
</div>
</a>
</section>
</div>
<div class="desktop-nav__item" data-mega-item="">
<a aria-controls="megaIndustries" aria-expanded="false" class="desktop-nav__trigger" href="/industries/">
